{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Iron Dice is a grand strategy game set in a distant yet familiar medieval world. The old empire has collapsed, and the remaining states are at war. Choose one of 60+ kingdoms, each with its own culture, history, and goals. Tell your own story as you decide whether to rebuild the empire or fight for independence. Some paths are easier than others, but each will require foresight, guile, and strength. Let the iron dice roll!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640650/extras/17e77f3a2a168da9568619a523d5db8b.avif?t=1759790307\" width=500 height=83 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640650/extras/51720ffa86b5f470218330c2798a5fce.poster.avif?t=1759790307\" width=590 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640650/extras/51720ffa86b5f470218330c2798a5fce.webm?t=1759790307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ Unique trade goods with dynamic pricing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Primary, secondary, and tertiary economic sectors with chaining bonuses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade province infrastructure and buildings for increased production</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charter companies to find and produce new goods</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s